    "identifier": "fire-release-rain-of-stars",
    "description": "<p>Blazing orbs of Fire plummet to the ground at four different points you can see within range. Each creature in a 20-foot-radius sphere centered on each point you choose must make a Dexterity saving throw. The sphere spreads around corners. A creature takes 10d8+10 Fire damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. A creature in the area of more than one fiery burst is affected a maximum of once.</p>",
